WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.600
Episode 19

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.600
Homeland in Space<i> !
</i>Mother Sheds Tears for Your Sake

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.600
( Air date: Feb 9, 1975 )

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.600
Goodbye, Earth.{Saraba chikyuu yo}

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.400
A ship is taking off...{Tabidatsu fune wa}

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:40.550
...it's the space battleship Yamato.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:40.290
Space Battleship

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:40.290
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.000
It's about to take off to Iscandar...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.410
...carrying the fate of humanity.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:54.800
We'll return for sure.{Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to}

00:00:55.300 --> 00:01:03.600
Smile back at the people waving their hands.{te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae}

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.400
Leaving the Galactic System and
taking a long journey to Iscandar.{Ginga wo hanare Iscandar he harubaru nozomu}

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:17.100
Space battleship Yamato!{Ucyuu senkan yamato}

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:41.220
In 2199, Earth was attacked by Meteor Bombs
from the mysterious planet Gamilus...

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:45.780
{SONO}...and mankind was facing extinction in one
year due to the radioactive contamination.

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:02.080
{CHIKYUU}The space battleship Yamato, the first
Earth ship to exceed the speed of light...

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.480
{CHIKYUU}...has left for Iscandar to
obtain the radioactive purifier.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.880
Galactic System

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:15.830
Iscandar is 148,000 light years away in the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:16.930
Large Magellanic Cloud

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:20.930
{GENZAI}Their current destination is
the mid-point, Planet Balan.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:23.880
{YAMATO}Balan appears to be a beacon
in space for the Yamato...

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:27.580
{YAMATO}...but it's also a Gamilus supply
base for the invasion of Earth.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:29.970
Planet Balan

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.630
{Domel}After being assigned as commander of
the Solar System region operations...

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:37.830
{Domel}...a famed admiral, Domel, has just
arrived on Planet Balan with his fleet.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:40.880
{BALAN}Using Balan as
his main base...

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:44.830
{BALAN}...Admiral Domel is like a space wolf
sharpening its fangs to kill the Yamato.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.430
Admiral Domel

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.170
The Yamato is 4 days away
from Planet Balan.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:16.570
Take a deep breath.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:18.830
And stop.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:21.310
Now let it out,
and open your mouth.

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:34.040
Nothing seems
to be wrong.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.510
But my ears are
ringing so hard.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:40.550
You say you're pale, have no
appetite, and can't sleep, huh ?

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:48.360
Indeed.  Your pulse is fast,
and your blood pressure is low.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.090
You're mentally exhausted, Aihara.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:55.930
After staying in this ship's enclosed
spaces for more than a hundred days...

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:57.960
...you might as
well be stressed out.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.930
Submit this to Chief
Environmental Officer Mori...

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:04.100
...and receive therapy
in the Image Room.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.220
Thank you very much.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:11.570
If only he drank sake...

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:18.830
Please, sit there.
I'm setting up now.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:22.410
Aihara, you're from
Iwate, aren't you ?

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:25.820
It's a nice place.
What kind of music do you want ?

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.160
Kitakawa Yakyoku.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.460
Okay, you'll be relaxed.
Just a moment.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:34.260
Begin 3D holographic
image therapy.

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:40.280
Mom.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:45.910
Mom.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:51.930
Mom.

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:52.590
This is fake !

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:55.930
It's fake.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.630
Fake.  Fake.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.770
This is fake.
This is all fake !

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:03.590
Aihara...

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.790
Hey, move.
Move aside.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:10.880
Hey, let us through.
Step aside.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:22.710
It's the first communication since we left
the Solar System. It brings back memories.

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:27.790
It's impressive to be able to establish
communications 70,000 light years from Earth.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:30.530
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:34.120
Hey, where's Chief Communications
Officer Aihara ?  He's not around.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.440
This is the Yamato. This is
Captain Okita of the Yamato.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.390
United Nations Yamato Project
Headquarters, do you copy ?

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:47.480
This is United Nations
Yamato Project Headquarters.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.590
You're coming in
clear, Captain Okita.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:54.930
It's been about 100 days
since you left Earth.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:58.090
What is your prediction for the remaining
round trip time from Iscandar ?

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:03.150
The Yamato executes a warp twice
a day at 0800 and 1600 ship time.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.610
{KONO}We travel 1200 light
years with each warp.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:11.610
{KOREMADE}We're behind by 61,000 light years and 51 days, due to obstacles and enemy attacks...

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:13.790
{KONO}...but thanks to warping...

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:19.480
{KONO}...we should be able to return in 152 days
after retrieving the radiation purifier.  Over.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:21.960
I'm relieved.
So relieved.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:25.280
Since the Yamato destroyed
the Gamilus Pluto base...

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.530
...we haven't had to suffer from
any more meteor bombs attacks.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.080
The problem is the
radioactive poison.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.790
Everyone on Earth is waiting
for the Yamato's return...

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:35.500
...enduring the fear
of the radioactive poison.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.770
We're alright, so
do your best. Over.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.280
We're alright, too.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:42.990
This will end our transmission.
Good luck to the people on Earth.

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.010
That's a bunch of bull !

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:57.690
Yes, the Yamato is capable of warping,
but no one has ever been to Iscandar.

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.600
{MADA}No one knows the true
identity of the Gamilusians !

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:07.400
{WAREWARE}Gamilus is waiting for us in
this vast empty space before us !

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:11.790
{ISCANDAR}There's no guarantee that we'll
be able to reach Iscandar !

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:15.340
{SONNA}Do you think the people on Earth
believe in this hopeless Yamato ?

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.970
{CHIKYUU}Riots must be breaking
out everywhere on Earth.

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:24.090
Chief Communications Officer Aihara,
how do you know of Earth's status ?

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:37.550
Aihara...

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:57.430
Although I was hospitalized because
of my illness during this journey...

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:04.670
...thanks to my capable officers, the Yamato
is steadily approaching Planet Balan.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:09.500
I'm feeling well today,
so I invited you for dinner.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:15.870
Let's have a toast to the
beautiful future of Earth.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:17.990
Cheers.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:18.880
Cheers.

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:21.290
For the safety
of Earth, cheers.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:24.090
Captain, please get well soon.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:28.330
Dr. Sado,
I'm counting on you.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.830
Too bad Aihara
can't be here.

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:33.830
I gave him a shot.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:37.380
Then I told him to stay in
his room and get some rest.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.290
Captain, may I ask
you a question ?

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:42.280
Go ahead.

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:47.260
What Aihara said earlier
today has been bothering me.

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:49.840
Will the Yamato be
able to reach Iscandar ?

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:53.650
Will they give us
the radiation purifier ?

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:58.760
Will the Yamato be able to return
to Earth before mankind is extinct ?

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:03.100
Shima, that doesn't sound
like the Chief Navigator.

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:07.300
Don't you have any doubts ?
Is this journey so certain to you ?

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:08.490
No, that's...

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:10.930
What about you, Yuki ?

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:13.580
Mr. Sanada, Chief
Engine Operator Tokugawa ?

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.550
Dr. Sado, what about you ?

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:21.230
No one's sure,
and we all have concerns.

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:24.530
{AURNOWA}Although there are differences
in how strongly you feel...

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:26.890
...Aihara's outburst represented the
concerns of the entire crew of the Yamato.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.640
Shima...

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:33.510
Yes ?

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:36.270
Why don't we
believe in ourselves ?

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:39.280
Nothing is sure in life.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.930
One step ahead is
darkness in our lives...

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:45.490
...but if you're overly afraid,
you won't accomplish anything.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:50.790
Overcoming our fears, and believing in our
future is an important battle in our minds.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.390
Oh, Chief ?

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:53.080
I'll take over.

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.130
Are you feeling better ?

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:57.530
Why shouldn't I be ?
I'm not ill.

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:00.000
O...okay.
I'll leave it to you.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.200
This is Yamato,
this is Yamato.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.710
Is it Yoshikazu ?

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:30.910
Mom, can you hear me ?

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:34.530
Is it alright
to call so often ?

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:38.210
You have a special transmitter
I made, so no one should know.

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:39.340
How is Father doing ?

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.890
Actually...

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:32.230
Food is running out, and riots
break out nearly every day.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:33.380
Mom.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:39.720
He was concerned about me,
and joined the riot last time.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:44.600
If I knew that he'd come back like this,
I wouldn't have let him go.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:47.740
Honey.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:49.600
Dear.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.530
Yoshikazu...

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:53.690
Isn't Yoshikazu back yet ?

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:57.580
He's back. Look.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.020
Dad.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.530
It's Yoshikazu...

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.670
Yoshikazu...Yoshikazu...

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:07.570
Dear...

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:08.290
Dad !

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.250
Dad !

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:17.200
Dad !  Dad !

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:35.990
So that's what is
causing your stress.

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:37.530
That's right.

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:40.930
When I realized that communications
were re-established a few days ago...

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:43.630
...I called home
without thinking.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:49.030
And you continued your private calls
without the Captain's permission.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.280
That's right !
So what ?!

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.880
Can you blame me ?!

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.790
I'll report this
to the Captain.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.380
What's so wrong about
worrying about my family ?!

00:14:57.380 --> 00:15:00.630
Can you ignore the death
of a family member ?!

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:02.480
Is this ship full of a
bunch of demons ?!

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:04.860
Aihara !

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:25.790
Shima, why don't we stop this reckless
journey and head back to Earth ?

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.530
My father died,
and my mother will, too !

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.830
If I die, I want to do so where
my father and mother lived !

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:36.290
Shima, head back to Earth.

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:41.240
Yes, we will, after we obtain the
radiation purifier from Iscandar.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:44.890
Aihara !

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.380
Shima, did Aihara
come up here ?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:55.680
He did, and he ran that way.
He was acting strange.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:58.640
That's why I'm following him.
I have to take him to sickbay.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:07.920
Who's there ?

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.790
Wait !  Who is it ?!
What's going on ?!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.550
Hello, this is
Kato on watch.

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:20.480
Oh, Chief Kodai...

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:21.310
Aihara did ?

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:22.790
That's right.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.930
What ?  You saw
someone's shadow ?

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:27.710
That's it.  It must be Aihara.
Okay, I'll be right there.

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:32.010
Aihara seems to be
hiding near the hangar.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.400
Alright, let's go.

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:38.380
My God,
it's terrible, Kodai.

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:42.290
When I was reading a book and
looked out the window, I saw Aihara...

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:44.990
H...he got off the ship ?!

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:04.170
Dad, Mom, I'll
return home soon !

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:21.880
Planet Balan

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:27.680
Solar System Region Mission Planning HQ

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:34.880
Admiral Domel

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:35.230
I found this in the Ruby System.
It's quite rare.

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:41.120
You seem to be quite relaxed. Do you have a plan to defeat the Yamato, already ?

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:44.650
Of course. The Yamato is
heading for Balan now.

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:49.220
{YAMATO}They probably don't realize
Balan is a Gamilus base.

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:53.730
{YAMATO}Balan is only a way point for the
Yamato.  It's like a lighthouse.

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:58.740
{SOKONI}That's where we have an opportunity.
I'll draw the Yamato to Balan, and destroy it.

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:02.230
{DAGA}But before that, I took
another measure just in case.

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:03.090
Such as...?

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:08.680
{YAMATO}It's a simple plan to disturb
the morale of the Yamato crew.

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:11.580
{YAMATO}I re-established communications
between the Yamato and Earth...

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:14.140
{YAMATO}...so they can see the
horrible reality on Earth.

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:17.980
{NINGEN}Humans can't be calm
in such a situation.

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:21.400
How did you make
communications possible ?

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:24.960
{RELAY}I positioned a relay probe
just behind the Yamato.

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:49.620
Black Tiger team,
this is Kodai.

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:53.590
When you find Aihara, use the
call sign SP03. Got that ?

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:04.300
An antenna ?

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.930
A relay probe ?

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.840
This isn't from the Yamato.

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:10.930
But for what ?

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:11.930
Gamilus...?

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:19.140
I see, communication wasn't re-established
naturally, it was a trap by Gamilus.

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:23.930
I was trapped by their plan,
and my morale was affected.

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:28.830
{JINRUI}Gamilus is the one who killed my father
and is driving mankind into extinction.

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:32.830
{ORE}And I was on the
Yamato to fight them !

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:36.380
{SOUDA}That's right !
Where's the Yamato ?

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.330
{SOUDA}I have to return
to the Yamato !

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:42.120
The Yamato...

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:51.730
No !
No, no, no !

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:56.490
I was left behind !

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:15.160
What's that ?

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:26.270
Hey !

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:30.890
SP03, SP03, this is Kodai.
I found Aihara.

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:42.100
Aihara, are you alright ?

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:44.990
Kodai.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:51.490
This is a Gamilus relay probe.
Kodai, we must destroy it.

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:52.140
Alright.

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:12.330
Aihara, you shoot.

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:12.990
Okay.

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:18.580
Now.

00:22:36.610 --> 00:22:39.700
So communication with
Earth is lost again.

00:22:39.700 --> 00:22:43.460
Next time we can call them
is when we return to Earth.

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:47.340
Right.  We have to believe
that day will come.

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:50.930
Hey, Aihara, look.

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:53.750
There are your friends
who came out to search for you.

00:22:53.750 --> 00:22:58.280
I caused them so much trouble.
I wonder if they'll forgive me.

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:02.090
Of course they will,
because that's what friends are.

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:04.280
This is Kodai.

00:23:04.280 --> 00:23:08.480
I destroyed a Gamilus relay
probe and rescued Aihara.

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:10.440
Returning to
the Yamato. Over.

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:15.090
The Yamato continues
its journey to Iscandar.

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:19.750
What will the future hold for the Yamato
at the halfway point, Planet Balan ?

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:25.180
Hurry, Yamato.  The people on
Earth are waiting for your return.

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:29.340
Mankind will extinct in 255 days.

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:31.880
Only 255 days are left.

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:38.190
255 days left until the destruction of Earth

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:45.350
Okita Juzo:

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:45.350
Naya Goro

00:23:44.340 --> 00:23:52.940
A girl was waving her red scarf.{Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf}

00:23:45.620 --> 00:23:50.850
Mori Yuki:

00:23:45.620 --> 00:23:50.850
Asagami Yoko

00:23:51.120 --> 00:23:56.360
Aihara's Father:

00:23:51.120 --> 00:23:56.360
Yasuhara Yoshikazu

00:23:52.940 --> 00:24:01.740
Who was that for ?{Dareno tame da to omotte iruka}

00:23:57.920 --> 00:24:07.410
Notes:
When Sado hands over a prescription to Aihara, an orderly serves sake to Sado's cup,
but it was edited out.

00:24:01.740 --> 00:24:10.040
It doesn't matter who it was for...{Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka}

00:24:07.410 --> 00:24:17.410
Notes:
Okita has a dinner with the upper ranking officers. Judging from the blue arrow and white uniform, the one who served wine was a member of the Living Environment group.

